   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\nDear,\r\n<div><span style=\"white-space:pre\"></span>when I using the methylkit, I import the sorted BAM file using samtools, but R give an error. What should I do? </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Best </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Wangze</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>The following is my R code:</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&#39;Andale Mono&#39;;color:rgb(40,254,20);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.901961)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&gt; library(methylKit)</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&#39;Andale Mono&#39;;color:rgb(40,254,20);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.901961)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&gt; myfile = system.file(&quot;extdata&quot;, &quot;cvi.deduplicated.sorted.bam&quot;, package = &quot;methylKit”)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:&#39;Andale Mono&#39;;color:rgb(40,254,20);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.901961)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&gt; obj=processBismarkAln(myfile,&quot;test&quot;,assembly=&quot;tair10&quot;,save.folder=NULL,save.context=&quot;CpG&quot;,read.context=&quot;CpG&quot;)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal;min-height:16px\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"></span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"> *** caught segfault ***</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">address 0x41, cause &#39;memory not mapped&#39;</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal;min-height:16px\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"></span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">Traceback:</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"> 1: .Call(&quot;methylKit_methCall&quot;, PACKAGE = &quot;methylKit&quot;, read1, type,     nolap, minqual, mincov, phred64, CpGfile, CHHfile, CHGfile)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"> 2: methCall(read1 = location, type = &quot;bam&quot;, nolap = nolap, minqual = minqual,     mincov = mincov, phred64 = phred64, CpGfile = out.files[[&quot;CpG&quot;]],\r\n     CHHfile = out.files[[&quot;CHH&quot;]], CHGfile = out.files[[&quot;CHG&quot;]])</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"> 3: .local(location, <a href=\"http://sample.id\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sample.id&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232240479000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2KaUsclpMisUSyjtfEE6Md\">sample.id</a>, assembly, save.folder, save.context,     read.context, nolap, mincov, minqual, phred64, save.db)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"> 4: processBismarkAln(myfile, &quot;test&quot;, assembly = &quot;tair10&quot;, save.folder = NULL,     save.context = &quot;CpG&quot;, read.context = &quot;CpG&quot;)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"> 5: processBismarkAln(myfile, &quot;test&quot;, assembly = &quot;tair10&quot;, save.folder = NULL,     save.context = &quot;CpG&quot;, read.context = &quot;CpG&quot;)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal;min-height:16px\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"></span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">Possible actions:</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">1: abort (with core dump, if enabled)</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">2: normal R exit</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">3: exit R without saving workspace</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">4: exit R saving workspace</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
